("p", "4Na + O<sub>2</sub> &rarr; 2Na<sub>2</sub>O; 2Mg + O<sub>2</sub> &rarr; 2MgO; 2Cu + O<sub>2</sub> &rarr; 2CuO; 4Al + 3O<sub>2</sub> &rarr; 2Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>."),
("note", "DEFINITION", "Metal oxides that react with **both acids and bases** to give salt and water are **amphoteric oxides**, e.g. aluminium oxide and zinc oxide: Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> + 6HCl &rarr; 2AlCl<sub>3</sub> + 3H<sub>2</sub>O; Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> + 2NaOH &rarr; 2NaAlO<sub>2</sub> + H<sub>2</sub>O."),
